A child started the way build tools start processes receives its
arguments unchanged through catter: spaces, quotes, backslashes, empty and
non-ASCII arguments, shell metacharacters. The first run is the baseline
without catter.

RUN: %e2e probe argv | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe argv | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS argv
